This repository redistributes and adapts content from the OWASP Cheat Sheet
Series.

Original work:
  Title:   OWASP Cheat Sheet Series
  Author:  The OWASP Cheat Sheets Series Team
  Source:  https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/
  Repo:    https://github.com/OWASP/CheatSheetSeries
  License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)
           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Changes made to the original in this repository:
  - Mirrored the published cheat sheets as plain Markdown files, one file per
    cheat sheet.
  - Reorganized the cheat sheets into 21 domain-specific category folders
    (e.g. Authentication, Injection, Cryptography_and_Keys), each with its
    own `resources/` directory.
  - Added a root `SKILL.md` that routes a security review or hardening
    request to the matching category, and a `SKILL.md` per category that
    lists its cheat sheets and a review workflow. These routing/workflow
    files are original content, not mirrored OWASP text (see `LICENSE-CODE`).

Because the OWASP Cheat Sheet Series is licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0, the
mirrored materials under `*/resources/**` remain under CC BY-SA 4.0.
Attribution to the OWASP Cheat Sheets Series Team is required and is
provided here and in the README.

